sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>pages/chat.py
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>main.py: chat_stream()
    participant PIPE as AdaptiveRAGPipeline<br/>query_stream()
    participant LLM as LLMGateway

    UI->>API: POST /api/chat/stream {question}
    API->>PIPE: query_stream(question)

    loop Các bước trung gian (classify / routing / context...)
        PIPE-->>API: "__STEP__" + JSON
        API-->>UI: SSE event: step
        Note over UI: render vào expander<br/>"Các bước xử lý"
    end

    PIPE-->>API: "__CITATIONS__" + JSON
    API-->>UI: SSE event: citations (render card [n])

    PIPE->>LLM: generate_stream(GENERATION_PROMPT)
    loop Từng token
        LLM-->>PIPE: token
        PIPE-->>API: token (chuỗi thường, không tiền tố)
        API-->>UI: SSE event: token
    end

    Note over PIPE: _post_process() chạy SAU token cuối:<br/>verify 3 tầng + confidence 6 tín hiệu
    PIPE-->>API: "__VERIFICATION__" + JSON<br/>(kèm refusal_answer nếu refused)
    API-->>UI: SSE event: verification
    Note over UI: badge tin cậy — nếu refused thì<br/>THAY câu trả lời bằng refusal
    API-->>UI: SSE event: done
